nk it’s important to ask the user what they’d like to do next to keep the conversation flowing smoothly. Keeping it brief with 1-3 sentences feels right to avoid overwhelming them. Let’s see where this goes!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hi — I’m LoopBot, calm and clear by design, and I’m here to help you think through health questions safely and practically. What would you like to do today?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_048cee2b76109a950169b82e34b7988191a40445c24827a92c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1195,"output":84,"cacheRead":8704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9983,"cost":{"input":0.0029875,"output":0.00126,"cacheRead":0.002176,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0064235}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773678129346}}
