y, and give next-step guidance.\n\nSo: the skill appears structurally functional, but **live distillation is not working yet because auth is missing**. If you want, I can next help you wire in the Hugging Face token and rerun the same synthetic test end-to-end.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_048cee2b76109a950169b82e79a8748191bed148d3338bb080\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":461,"output":241,"cacheRead":11904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12606,"cost":{"input":0.0011525,"output":0.003615,"cacheRead":0.002976,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0077435}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773678191354}}
